OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBright or sunny spells through
OL,6,Fthe day and staying mostly dry with
OL,7,Fjust the odd light shower, mainly
OL,8,Facross Tayside, Angus and Fife during
OL,9,Fthe afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FMost places will be dry with
OL,12,Fclear spells this evening and
OL,13,Fovernight, though a few showers are
OL,14,Fpossible at first, mainly across
OL,15,FAngus. Turning rather cold with light
OL,16,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
