OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FA cold, clear start with
OL,6,Frisk of frost. Then remaining dry and
OL,7,Fsettled through the day with plenty of
OL,8,Fsunshine and just a few patches of
OL,9,Fcloud in the afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FDry and
OL,12,Fsettled on Sunday with sunshine.
OL,13,FPartly cloudy on Monday with some
OL,14,Fsunny spells, before turning more
OL,15,Fwidely cloudy on Tuesday with the risk
OL,16,Fof patchy rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
